{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The digital caliper fits my recent screw and washer purchases because it would help me measure parts and find matching sizes.",
    "The caliper supports the fastening tasks I already have supplies for, giving me a concrete reason to choose it now."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Heat shrink tubing, electrical terminals, and electrical tape require a wiring task I do not currently have; buying hardware assortments does not mean I need electrical supplies.",
    "The thermal camera and clamp meter serve inspection and troubleshooting needs that my recent mounting purchases do not suggest.",
    "Bulk trash liners and dispensing bottles do not help me match fasteners or mount hooks, so I would skip them without a specific need."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The recommendations seem to treat workshop supplies as broadly interchangeable, although fastening parts and repairing wiring are different tasks for me.",
    "Several recommendations are assortment kits, but having many sizes or pieces only appeals to me when those pieces serve my current project."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent purchases cluster around nuts, bolts, locking washers, and magnetic hooks, making fastening and mounting the clearest current interests.",
    "A useful next purchase would help me work with the parts I already bought, as the caliper would, without requiring an unrelated project.",
    "I rarely interact unless I can identify an immediate use, so a loose connection to tools or garage work is not enough."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized a practical hardware interest but mostly extended it into electrical work instead of supporting my current fastening and mounting tasks."
}"}
